      "color": "#C0A060",
      "dialogue": [
        "Hello! Hello! Anyone there? Anyone at all?",
        "Oh! I know that voice. Just how long has it been? It's me, Siegward of Catarina. I'm loathe to admit it, but I've been had. Someone's swiped my armour. Did you happen to see it anywhere?",
        "Oh, yes, I see... Not to worry. Great planning begets great fortune. An old tenet of the Knights of Catarina. And I am a master planner, I do say!",
        "I'm in quite a pickle indeed. I've got to use my head. And think. Hmm... Mmm..."
      ]
    },
